# Controller UI Embedding & Routing

## Embedding
- Embed UI assets from `redbench/internal/controller/ui/` using `embed.FS`.
- Provide a helper that returns a sub-FS for `ui/`:
  - `getUIFS() (fs.FS, error)` implemented via `fs.Sub(uiFS, "ui")`.
- Keep the embed pattern compatible with nested assets; prefer `ui/*` now, expand to `ui/**` if subfolders are added.

## Routing
- Mount static handler under `/ui/` using `http.FileServer(http.FS(uiFS))` and `http.StripPrefix("/ui/", ...)`.
- Add redirect from `/ui` → `/ui/` (301/308) for a clean base path.
- Keep existing API routes unchanged and colocated with `/metrics` and `/health`.

## Testability
- Add a minimal route test that ensures `/ui/` serves an asset successfully.
- Avoid coupling tests to specific content beyond status and content-type.

## Future Extraction
- Keep UI strictly consuming REST endpoints so it can move to a separate service.
- When extracting, serve a small runtime config for API base (e.g., `/ui/config.js`).

